  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Environmentally Sound Management of Earthquake Debris and Safe Disposal of Hazardous Waste in Adiyaman Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP, in partnership with the Ministry of Environment, Urbanization and Climate Change (MoEUCC), has already piloted a debris management project in Hatay and Kahramanmaras provinces. That initiative successfully established two nonhazardous recycling facilities and introduced mobile curshers to reduce the demolition waste volume, recycle recyclable waste and safely handle hazardous waste. The lessons learned and best practices from this project provide a strong foundation for scaling up interven</narrative>
  </description>
